      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "Defining the layer’s transform rotates the viewpoint in 3D space and, because `layer` is a [`CATransformLayer`](catransformlayer.md), all three layers are visible as illustrated below.",
      "normalizedSource": "Defining the layer’s transform rotates the viewpoint in 3D space and, because `layer` is a [`CATransformLayer`](catransformlayer.md), all three layers are visible as illustrated below.",
